+|---|---|---:|---|
+| Configure (Qt 5 tree) | `/usr/bin/cmake -S . -B build-qt5 ... -DWANT_QT6=OFF ...` | 0 | `build-1-qt5-configure.log` (`-- Experimental Qt6 support : Disabled`) |
+| **RED** (original code) | `cmake --build build-qt5 --target ControlAutomationScriptTest` | **2** | `build-2-qt5-red.log`: `ControlCommandsScript.cpp:30:10: fatal error: QByteArrayView` |
