+## Scope note
+
+The packet's constraint was to fix the verified cause, the unguarded
+`QByteArrayView`. That is fixed (fix #1). Fixes #2-#4 are three more Qt-6-only
+assumptions that stop the same CI job; they were found by reproduction, not
+guessed, and each is a one-line, behaviour-preserving portability fix of the same
+class. Without them the packet's own outcome ("the linux-x86_64 build compiles")
+is unreachable and the regression test cannot build on Qt 5 at all. No Qt 5
+support was dropped, no minimum was raised, no CI gate was edited, and no test or
